<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Gas plans 159.5 bln yen 97/98 capital outlay.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Gas plans 159.5 bln yen 97/98 capital outlay.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo Gas Co Ltd said on Thursday that it plans capital investment of 159.5 billion yen in 1997/98.  </p>
<p>Tokyo Gas said in a statement it estimated it had spent a total of 152.6 billion yen in capital investment in the 1996/97 business year, which ended on March 31.</p>
